Knittt API Documentation
Authentication
All endpoints require authentication using a bearer token unless otherwise specified.

Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>
Some public endpoints may use X-Tenant-ID header instead
Content Creation API
Templates
Get Templates
GET /api/content/templates
Query Parameters:

category - Filter by category (welcome_screen, promotional_banner, etc.)
isPublic - Boolean, filter public/private templates
search - Search templates by name/description
page - Page number (default: 1)
limit - Items per page (default: 50)
Get Single Template
GET /api/content/templates/:templateId
Create Template
POST /api/content/templates
Body:

json
{
  "name": "Template Name",
  "description": "Description",
  "category": "welcome_screen",
  "canvasSize": { "width": 1920, "height": 1080 },
  "elements": {},
  "variables": {},
  "tags": ["tag1", "tag2"]
}
Projects
Get Projects
GET /api/content/projects
Query Parameters:

status - Filter by status (draft, published, archived)
search - Search projects
page - Page number
limit - Items per page
Create Project
POST /api/content/projects
Body:

json
{
  "name": "Project Name",
  "description": "Description",
  "templateId": "uuid",
  "canvasSize": { "width": 1920, "height": 1080 }
}
Get Single Project
GET /api/content/projects/:projectId
Update Project
PUT /api/content/projects/:projectId
Delete Project
DELETE /api/content/projects/:projectId
Elements
Create Element
POST /api/content/projects/:projectId/elements
Body:

json
{
  "elementType": "text",
  "position": { "x": 100, "y": 100, "z": 1 },
  "size": { "width": 200, "height": 50 },
  "properties": {},
  "styles": {}
}
Update Element
PUT /api/content/projects/:projectId/elements/:elementId
Delete Element
DELETE /api/content/projects/:projectId/elements/:elementId
Reorder Elements
PUT /api/content/projects/:projectId/elements/reorder
Body:

json
{
  "elementOrders": [
    { "elementId": "uuid", "layerOrder": 1 },
    { "elementId": "uuid", "layerOrder": 2 }
  ]
}
Assets
Get Assets
GET /api/content/assets
Query Parameters:

assetType - Filter by type (image, video, audio, etc.)
search - Search assets
tags - Comma-separated tags
page - Page number
limit - Items per page
Upload Asset
POST /api/content/assets/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Field: file - The file to upload
Field: name - Asset name
Field: tags - Comma-separated tags
Field: metadata - JSON string of metadata
Delete Asset
DELETE /api/content/assets/:assetId
Variables
Get Variables
GET /api/content/variables
Query Parameters:

category - Filter by category
dataSource - Filter by data source
Create Variable
POST /api/content/variables
Initialize System Variables
POST /api/content/variables/initialize-system
