OptiSync Integration
Get OptiSync Projects (Public)
GET /api/content/optisync/projects
Headers:

X-Tenant-ID - Required tenant identifier
Get OptiSync Data Feed (Public)
GET /api/content/optisync/projects/:projectId/feed
Headers:

X-Tenant-ID - Required tenant identifier Query Parameters:
format - Data format (default: json)
includeElements - Include elements (default: true)
includeAssets - Include assets (default: true)
lastUpdated - Filter by last update date
OptiSync Webhook (Public)
POST /api/content/optisync/projects/:projectId/webhook
Headers:

X-Tenant-ID - Required tenant identifier Body:
json
{
  "action": "refresh", // or "validate"
  "source": "manual"
}
Get OptiSync Configuration
GET /api/content/optisync/projects/:projectId/config
Query Parameters:

refreshInterval - Refresh interval in seconds
Get OptiSync Status
GET /api/content/optisync/status
Public Content
Serve Public Content (No Auth)
GET /api/content/public/:exportId
Get Content Info (No Auth)
GET /api/content/public/:exportId/info
System
Get System Status
GET /api/content/system/status
OptiSigns API
Configuration
Test API Connection
POST /api/optisigns/config/test
Body:

json
{
  "apiToken": "your-optisigns-api-token"
}
Update Configuration
PUT /api/optisigns/config
Body:

json
{
  "apiToken": "your-api-token",
  "settings": {}
}
Get Configuration
GET /api/optisigns/config
Displays
Sync Displays
POST /api/optisigns/displays/sync
Get Displays
GET /api/optisigns/displays
Query Parameters:

page - Page number (default: 1)
limit - Items per page (default: 50)
status - Filter by status
isOnline - Filter online/offline (true/false)
location - Filter by location
Get Single Display
GET /api/optisigns/displays/:id
Update Display
PUT /api/optisigns/displays/:id
Body:

json
{
  "name": "New Display Name",
  "location": "New Location"
}
Tags
Add Tags to Display
POST /api/optisigns/displays/:id/tags
Body:

json
{
  "tags": ["tag1", "tag2"]
}
Remove Tags from Display
DELETE /api/optisigns/displays/:id/tags
Body:

json
{
  "tags": ["tag1", "tag2"]
}
Takeover
Initiate Device Takeover
POST /api/optisigns/displays/:id/takeover
Body:

json
{
  "contentType": "ASSET", // or "PLAYLIST"
  "contentId": "uuid",
  "priority": "HIGH", // EMERGENCY, HIGH, NORMAL
  "duration": 300, // seconds, optional
  "message": "Takeover reason",
  "restoreAfter": true,
  "teamId": "optional-team-id"
}
Stop Takeover
POST /api/optisigns/displays/:id/stop-takeover
Body:

json
{
  "restoreContent": true,
  "reason": "Manual stop"
}
Get Takeover Status
GET /api/optisigns/displays/:id/takeover-status
List Takeovers
GET /api/optisigns/takeovers
Query Parameters:

page - Page number
limit - Items per page
priority - Filter by priority
status - Filter by status
displayId - Filter by display
